@@ ============================================================
@@ Tsolve — full Lambert solver, 10000 times
@@ A real workload: reads two 3-vectors, runs a bounded secant loop
@@ on the universal variable, and builds the result.
@@ Returns the elapsed time in milliseconds.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
